International License described in
`licenses/LICENSE-DATA-DOCS-CC-BY-4.0.txt`.

The attribution is intentionally anonymous for double-blind review. Identity
is not waived: a camera-ready or archival release must replace "The authors"
with the final attribution without changing the scientific payload.

Third-party software and excluded venue/template material retain their own
licenses. See `THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md`.
